B.MG=new A.y("Grandma's Chickens","Grandma's chickens escaped the coop. Help round them up!","Small responsibility today trains us for the big ones later.",B.K)
B.P2=new A.y("Village Well","One well is shared by many families. Take water in turns.","Queue and share the water \u2014 fair for all the neighbors.",B.K)
B.Oy=new A.y("Teacher Sari","Teacher Sari comes to school, even in heavy rain.","Teachers endure hardship for their students \u2014 respect and listen.",B.S)
B.Ph=new A.y("One-Room School","The village school has just one room. Books are shared in turns.","Sharing books and tools \u2014 so everyone can learn.",B.q)
B.Mw=new A.y("Morning Market","The village market is busy. Kiko greets the sellers kindly.","Greet and smile at the sellers \u2014 politeness is free.",B.S)
B.PH=new A.y("Lost Goat","A neighbor's goat got into someone's garden. Let us walk it home.","Help a neighbor without being asked \u2014 that is a kind heart.",B.q)
B.Mi=new A.y("Terraced Fields","The terraced rice fields need water. Each plot gets a fair share.","Share fairly \u2014 do not take more than your right.",B.K)
B.Nk=new A.y("River Source","The mountain river is so clear. Do not wash trash at the source.","Care for the water up high \u2014 the village below stays healthy.",B.E)
B.MT=new A.y("Community Work","The people clean the village road together this morning.","A clean place is the work of many, not just one.",B.E)
B.MC=new A.y("Farmer Grandpa","Grandpa the farmer harvests rice. Help carry it to the barn.","Helping the old is a great kindness.",B.q)
B.Nl=new A.y("Rice Barn","Rice is stored for the hard season. Do not waste it.","Save and store for later \u2014 that is wise.",B.K)
B.PV=new A.y("Grandma Tells Tales","Grandma tells village stories at night. Listen carefully.","Listen when elders speak \u2014 there is much wisdom there.",B.S)
B.PG=new A.y("Morning Chores","The village chief feeds the cows before sunrise.","Wake early and work hard \u2014 the habit of great people.",B.q)
B.Nf=new A.y("Night Watch","The people guard the village at night, taking turns at the post.","Keeping your turn keeps everyone safe.",B.K)
B.Ns=new A.y("New Friend","A child sits alone. Kiko invites them to play together.","Invite the lonely \u2014 no one likes being left out.",B.q)
